        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu anyana kaIsarela, tiyenu izu daYehova, muloŋa Yehova nenki ashakama mwituŋa muloŋa, muloŋa mwituŋa himudi kuhosha nsaŋu yalala, hela kwanakena, hela kwiluka Nzambuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mudi kwakusanyika, nakutwamba, nikujahana, nikwiya, nikwila wuvumbi; akuminaŋa dakudilundamu hohu, niwubanji wadilonda nawubanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ituŋa dakadila, niantu ejima ashakamamu akazeelela hamu nawanyama amumpata, nawatujila ahaluzwizu; mwalala, ninshi jamukaluŋalwiji akajifumishaku nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, bayi muntu azuŋa namukwawu hela kwinka mukwawu muloŋaku; muloŋa antu ami adi neyi antu azuŋaŋa nakapristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wakadimbuka namwa ana, kaprofwetu nawa wakadimbukila hamu naneyi nawufuku; ninami nakakisaŋana mama yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ami anakisikili kubula kwiluka; ochu chiwunaleki kwiluka, ninami nakakulekeyi, kulonda wubuli kwikala kapristu kami. Chiwunavulameni nshimbi jaNzambi yeyi, ami nawa nakavulamena anyaneyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chaswejeluwu kuvula, hiyakusweja nikunvulumuna. Nakabalumuna kulema kwawu kwakekali nsonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiilaŋa kunshidi yawantu ami, asha dehi nyichima yawu kukuluwa kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakela mukwikalila antu, dimu mukwikalila nikapristu; nakayibabesha nanjila jendaŋawu, nakayilubwila niyuma yelaŋawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akadya ilaŋa kwikuta nehi; akela wuvumbi ilaŋa kuvula nehi; muŋa wena analeki dehi kutiyilila kudi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuvumbi navinyu nivinyu yayiha yidi nakuyifumisha kashinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ami ehulaŋa maana kunyitondu yawu, nyishi yawu diyi yidi nakuyishimwina; spiritu yawujila yinayiluwishi, anafumi mwishina daNzambi yawu, anayi nakwila wuvumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adi nakuketula yimuna hewulu dampidi jamaneni; adi nakwocha yamavumba amawahi hamapidi, nimumashina anyisoli ninamutuseliseli, nimunyikula, nanochu chiyikweti wulelu wawuwahi. Dichi chakoŋelaŋawu wuvumbi anyanenu awambanda, ni aŋodi jenu hiyakwila wujila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakukoŋawu anyanenu awambanda wuvumbi, nichakwilawu aŋodi jenu wujila hinakayibabesha kwamuku; muloŋa awenawu amayala aambukaŋa kwakanka wawu nawayivumbi, aketulaŋa yimuna hamu nawatubola; antu akadi kashinshi akayidimbwisha hamaseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela eyi Isarela wudi nakukoŋakoŋa wuvumbi, eyi Yuda kweyi bayi wutamishaku. Bayi mwinza kuGiligali, hela kukanduka kuBetavenuku. Bayi wusanyika neyi, Chahandayi Yehova kwaamuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isarela wadikaŋaŋa neyi chadikaŋaŋayi iyoŋa daŋombi wamukaji. Ichi dinu Yehova wukuyidiisha neyi chadiishaŋawu mwana kamukoku muwudiilu weneni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi nadibombi dehi nawakishi akutuŋa, muleki tuhu kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yanwaŋawu yabatuka dehi; adi nakwila wuvumbi hefuku hefuku; anyuli jawu anakeŋi nankashi nsonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpepela yinayikumbakeshi mumpuula jindi; akatiya nsonyi nansaŋu yayimuna yawu yaketwiluwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
